rop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2d83ee41a139dc0af95ad0bc14421036", "src_set": ""}, "body": "ドラゴンボールの時の界王神（大人）が小さい魔神トワ（暗黒因子）が入った小瓶にお尻を当ててオナラしてるシーンをお願いします。ぶうぅぅ！と大きい音で小瓶の中はオナラの濃度がかなり濃い（トワが少し見えないぐらい）状態で色は濃い黄色、トワはオナラの匂いに悶絶してる状態、もし差分可能ならトワ無しバージョンお願いします。", "nc": 176, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@noteppe_poo931/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2803841, "client_id": 0, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/33f5cec0/uploads/origins/c23d1aa9-b255-431d-9da1-d7865727bc5f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f37d032c7b71596c1e0bf52cd292ffb0", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/33f5cec0/uploads/origins/c23d1aa9-b255-431d-9da1-d7865727bc5f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f9e0e6fc4d3a82b7a4e0341e14df2ad0", "src_set": ""}, "body": "ドラクエ10の魔勇者アンルシアが性格悪そうな顔で「そんなに私の屁を嗅ぎたいのか？」と言ってこちらにお尻を向ける、「いいぞ、しっかり嗅ぐが良い」と言って「ブボオォォ♡」と大量のオナラを漏らす。色は少し暗めの黄色でお願いします。", "nc": 32, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@noteppe_poo931/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2803841, "client_id": 0, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ec49a0c4/uploads/origins/c1c33bcd-3950-4714-b8d7-7a09a1c80b5f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=793d20c2d5ea7786ee0055635aa6dd45", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ec49a0c4/uploads/origins/c1c33bcd-3950-4714-b8d7-7a09a1c80b5f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9fb5bf441a64c48617f85a8fa079f4